u_new.ts = block.timestamp;
u_new.blk = block.number;
user_point_history[addr][user_epoch] = u_new;
// <-- lock/create/top-up/extend writes a checkpoint at the exact transaction timestamp
```

[`VotingEscrow.sol# L544-L576`](https://github.com/code-423n4/2026-03-intuition/blob/314b7d4/src/external/curve/VotingEscrow.sol# L544-L576)
