    _min = _mid;
    // <-- global checkpoint lookup is inclusive: ts == snapshot time is selected
} else {
    _max = _mid - 1;
}
```

[`VotingEscrow.sol# L590-L623`](https://github.com/code-423n4/2026-03-intuition/blob/314b7d4/src/external/curve/VotingEscrow.sol# L590-L623)
```

if (user_point_history[addr][_mid].ts <= _ts) {
    _min = _mid;
    // <-- user checkpoint lookup is inclusive too
} else {
