## Description

Function `getDynamicTradePriceImpact()` is supposed to calculate the trade price using the dynamic price impact method:
```solidity
        priceAfterImpact = uint192(price);

        priceImpactP = _priceImpactFunction(
            netVolThreshold,
            priceImpactK,
            trade.buy,
            isOpen,
            tradeNotional,
