    qiRedemptionAmount = qiDepositAmount - qiDepositAmount * registration.qiSlashPercentage / 10_000;

-   minimumContractBalance -= avaxDepositAmount;
+   minimumContractBalance -= avaxRedemptionAmount;
} else {
```

