4. fixedRatePool decides to decrease the LTV setting for asset2 to 60%
5. Position is no longer health because minReqCollateral = (1e18 * 1e18 / 0.6e18) + (1e18 * 1e18 / 0.7e18) = 1.666e18 + 1.428571e18 = 3.094571e18
