```diff
+       if (distributionFactor == 0 || totalEthSupply.wadMulDown(distributionFactor.scaleUpToWad(4) == 0) {
            return (ilkData.minimumKinkRate, ilkData.reserveFactor.scaleUpToRay(4));
        }
```

