Manual Review

## Recommendation
Pass the address of the user.

```diff
        require(
-            uint8(epoch) > 1 && !admin.blockClaim(address(this)),
+            uint8(epoch) > 1 && !admin.blockClaim(msg.sender)),
            "TokenSale: Not time or not allowed"
        );
```



