### Proof of Concept

When interest accrues, [we are calling](https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-11-betafinance/blob/0f1bb077afe8e8e03093c8f26dc0b7a2983c3e47/Omni_Protocol/src/OmniToken.sol#L104)

