<https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-06-lybra/blob/5d70170f2c68dbd3f7b8c0c8fd6b0b2218784ea6/contracts/lybra/pools/base/LybraPeUSDVaultBase.sol#L157-L168>

### Recommended Mitigation Steps

Change to:

```diff
