### Recommended Mitigation Steps

The `LiquidityPool._getDelta` and `LiquidityPool._calculateMargin` functions can be updated to execute `require(!isInvalid && spotPrice > 0)` instead of `require(!isInvalid || spotPrice > 0)`.

