[ConnextPriceOracle.sol#L122-L140](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-06-connext/blob/b4532655071566b33c41eac46e75be29b4a381ed/contracts/contracts/core/connext/helpers/ConnextPriceOracle.sol#L122-L140)<br>

