[ExtraRewardsDistributor.sol#L233-L240](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-05-aura/blob/4989a2077546a5394e3650bf3c224669a0f7e690/contracts/ExtraRewardsDistributor.sol#L233-L240)<br>
